1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,974
周会前，我在项目目录打开 Codex，
Before our weekly meeting, I open Codex in the project folder

2
00:00:04,128 --> 00:00:08,883
请它把这周合入的改动整理成三条，发给设计组。
and ask for three updates on this week’s changes for the design team.

3
00:00:09,545 --> 00:00:14,024
出门后，同事问我，第二条对用户有什么影响？
While I’m out, a colleague asks how the second change affects users.

4
00:00:14,295 --> 00:00:18,920
我打开飞书，给机器人发「/sessions 产品更新」。
I open Feishu and send the bot “/sessions 产品更新” to find the conversation.

5
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,532
核对项目和上次问的问题，点「切换到此会话」，
I check the project and the last question, then select the session.

6
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:27,635
就能直接追问：「把第二条展开，举个例子。」
I can ask, “Expand the second point and give me an example.”

7
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:32,571
如果这份更新是在 Claude Code 里写的，也能这样接着聊。
The same handoff works if I started the update in Claude Code.

8
00:00:33,758 --> 00:00:36,852
答复就出现在原来的飞书话题里。
The reply appears in the original Feishu thread.

9
00:00:37,128 --> 00:00:41,928
我打开卡片底部的「详情与操作」，点「生成分享卡」，
I open Details & actions at the bottom of the card and choose Create share card.

10
00:00:42,045 --> 00:00:45,048
确认正文，再转发到设计群。
I check the text and forward it to the design group.

11
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:51,905
同事收到的是一张只读卡片，能看到这次的答复、使用的引擎和模型。
My colleagues get a read-only card with the answer, the engine, and the model.

12
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:55,833
点底部的 my-agents，还能打开项目仓库。
The my-agents link at the bottom opens the project repository.

13
00:00:56,503 --> 00:01:00,823
回到电脑，我在网页的「对话」里打开刚才那一条。
Back at my desk, I open the same session under Conversations.

14
00:01:01,087 --> 00:01:08,296
终端里写的初稿、飞书里的追问都在，可以继续改，也可以回到原终端接着做。
The terminal draft and Feishu follow-up are both there. I can edit here or return to my terminal.

15
00:01:09,467 --> 00:01:12,427
这份更新里有一项改动需要验证。
One of these changes still needs verification.

16
00:01:12,712 --> 00:01:20,112
我在同一个面板里让 Mac 上的 Claude Code 检查代码，再让 Linux 服务器上的 Codex 跑测试。
From one panel, I ask Claude Code on the Mac to review the code and Codex on the Linux server to run the tests.

17
00:01:20,378 --> 00:01:26,268
同一个项目，在工作站、服务器和构建机上可以放在不同目录。
The workstation, server, and build machine can each have their own checkout.

18
00:01:26,545 --> 00:01:31,265
选好机器，任务就在那台机器的项目目录里执行。
Once I choose a machine, the task runs in its project folder.

19
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:35,801
Mac 开启保活，屏幕熄了也能继续接任务。
With keep-awake enabled, the Mac can take tasks even when the display is off.

20
00:01:36,087 --> 00:01:39,925
如果部署了三台完整面板，即使 Mac 关机，
With a full panel on each of three machines, the Mac can shut down.

21
00:01:40,045 --> 00:01:46,012
只要另外两台保持在线，服务器就能接手后续发来的飞书消息。
As long as the other two stay online, the server can take over new Feishu messages.

22
00:01:47,175 --> 00:01:51,640
如果你习惯用 Claude Code，手上有自己的模型网关，
If you like working in Claude Code and already have a model gateway,

23
00:01:51,795 --> 00:01:59,747
只要网关兼容 Anthropic Messages API，就可以在「AI 账号」里点「连接自定义代理」，
choose Connect a custom proxy under AI accounts if your gateway supports the Anthropic Messages API.

24
00:01:59,878 --> 00:02:01,916
选用网关提供的模型。
You can use the models your gateway provides.

25
00:02:02,587 --> 00:02:10,744
如果你已经有带 Codex 权限的 ChatGPT 订阅，这一个订阅也能给两种工具用。
A ChatGPT subscription that includes Codex can power both coding tools.

26
00:02:11,003 --> 00:02:17,000
登录后，既可以在 Codex 里工作，也可以选择「使用 Codex 订阅代理」，
After signing in, use Codex directly or choose Use Codex subscription proxy.

27
00:02:17,128 --> 00:02:20,862
让 GPT 给 Claude Code 提供回答。
GPT can then answer in Claude Code.

28
00:02:21,128 --> 00:02:26,868
文件还是由 Claude Code 在你选的电脑上修改，命令也在那里运行。
Claude Code edits files and runs commands on the computer you selected.

29
00:02:27,545 --> 00:02:30,686
你可以给两个工具分别设默认模型。
Each tool can have its own default model.

30
00:02:30,962 --> 00:02:37,525
想给某个飞书话题换模型，发「/model」选一个，下一轮就会用上。
Send “/model” in a Feishu thread to choose a model for the next turn.

31
00:02:37,795 --> 00:02:42,420
网关有固定映射时，以网关实际调用的模型为准。
If your gateway has a fixed mapping, it determines which model handles the request.

32
00:02:43,592 --> 00:02:47,202
周会前，设计群里又补了两条意见。
Before the meeting, two more comments arrive in the design group.

33
00:02:47,462 --> 00:02:54,747
接入个人飞书后，助理会结合是谁发的、后面怎么回复、现有任务做到哪一步，
With my Feishu account connected, the assistant considers the senders, follow-ups, and progress on existing work.

34
00:02:54,878 --> 00:02:57,411
把相关消息合成一条建议。
It groups the related messages into one suggestion.

35
00:02:57,670 --> 00:03:04,826
我核对后点确认，两条意见就送回刚才的会话，不用再复制一遍聊天记录。
I review it and approve. Both comments go to the same session, saving me a copy and paste.

36
00:03:06,008 --> 00:03:11,046
装好 Node.js 后，在终端运行屏幕上的命令，
With Node.js installed, I run the command on screen

37
00:03:11,170 --> 00:03:13,381
打开浏览器里的本地面板。
and open the local panel in my browser.

38
00:03:13,628 --> 00:03:18,463
连上飞书，就可以从手头正在做的那条对话开始。
Once Feishu is connected, I can pick up the conversation I’m already working on.
